{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"30ca01767ca15858f4d201f50f5933a83d74671950e60c1df017d5771fe62c7e","ja":"あ、風花さん、そこにあるお水、\n未来に渡してもらえませんか？","zh":"啊，风花小姐，能不能把那边的水\n递给未来呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"47cfca769a46f95b2b752c26543390174f81306a28b4a1daf95b426100ff8ce8","ja":"えっ……？　う、うん。これね。","zh":"诶……？嗯、嗯。是这个吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"48ee9ab0669030ea85146e274215ccdb84428340f28abcdf22de355e5da96930","ja":"はい、未来ちゃん、お水どうぞ。","zh":"给，未来，喝水吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d7b3e64a14dbb1d49eb34748c8a7304750d41120622fe29d0b3fcda381e019c7","ja":"ありがとうございま～す♪\nゴクゴクゴク……んんっ！　","zh":"谢谢您～♪\n咕嘟咕嘟咕嘟……嗯嗯！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"b4e4094446c5b76600720c03da685f698d1eedfe67f559e4f02106d5fd07ad96","ja":"おいしい！　なんておいしい水なんだー！\nこの水を作ったシェフを呼べー！","zh":"真好喝！这水也太好喝了吧——！\n把做出这水的大厨给我叫来——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"40111211da417441deac671b6d44b51d8e4a3be12f6ef60df84dd9347d23f7a5","ja":"シェフの田中です。どうされましたか？","zh":"我是主厨田中。请问有什么事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"e3ba14f6beac9a3c71c133b64a3ae16b87f3b0d313b16f271570a9cbaf27a83c","ja":"えっ！　それ、ペットボトルのお水で、シェフは\n作ってないから！　って、琴葉ちゃんがシェフなの！？","zh":"咦！那个是瓶装水，厨师\n根本没做过啦！等等，小琴叶就是厨师吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"2dced21a99fc7cc0dce28333b0ace295a7162ab315804962e905870f031e4d12","ja":"風花さん、ナイスツッコミです！　でへへ～♪\nなんか、すぱーんって決まりましたね！","zh":"风花小姐，吐槽得真漂亮！嘿嘿～♪\n感觉一下子就精准切中要害了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"e376bfc69f6539ced6a7466c42e67835e60f094726f97028cc8f8605c43035f4","ja":"的確でタイミングのいいツッコミ……やっぱり、\n私たちには風花さんが必要なんです！","zh":"准确而恰到好处的吐槽……果然，\n我们还是需要风花小姐啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4dc73300573c569f4a5f8631148a6f0f745076846e4ef823acf714af247d8921","ja":"えぇぇっ！　今のって、わざとだったの！？\nで、でも、いくら褒められても漫才は……。","zh":"诶诶诶！刚才那是故意的吗！？\n可、可是，就算被夸奖了，漫才也还是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"f3c8bcca8f561ace2988e346d8eb5b722ae9867ef959c096ff01a686f214c89e","ja":"大丈夫ですって！\nね、志保と百合子もそう思うよね！","zh":"没问题的啦！\n对吧，志保和百合子也这么觉得吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"22c496f28eb6f1ded3535d4259699039fef701f72dc164c62fdb1cdd43f92148","ja":"そうね……。前に見た未来と琴葉さんの漫才より、\n面白くなってるかも。","zh":"说的也是……比之前看过的未来和琴叶的相声，\n可能还要更有趣呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"d61aeee2208d6629e4e72b205560887c3dc2ff5e51ee128e24f2ec1f270d65de","ja":"ふふっ♪　私も、面白かったな。\n風花さんが入ったら、いいトリオになりそうですね♪","zh":"呵呵♪　我也觉得很有意思呢。\n要是风花小姐也加入的话，感觉会成为很棒的三人组合呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"b236c1e4b8ad3c6957d8f1de05c4763bd23725babd3080f1c9b3f4f0fdc90fc5","ja":"そ、そんなこと言われても……\nわ、私がなりたいのは、正統派アイドルだから！","zh":"就、就算你这么说……\n我、我想成为的，可是正统派偶像啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"3239df498a11c9ad9f27ab9969461049e932b43f07337f0156991cb547d030f6","ja":"あっ、逃げられちゃった！\nうまくいくと思ったんだけどなー。","zh":"啊，被逃掉了！\n本来以为会挺顺利的呢～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1352.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"f0cc8e054a8ba1e502ba9cf175b6091c835de03cec8b209eba8348b69a6a6a09","ja":"はあ、仕方ないわね……。\nあんなに嫌がってるなら諦めるしかないか……。","zh":"唉，真拿你没办法呢……。\n既然那么讨厌的话，也只能放弃了吗……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
